 "notes": "Observed 95% CL exclusion from Fig. 7 (Limit6WithError.pdf in the e-print), UPLOAD room-temperature upconversion haloscope power-detection run, 1.12-1.20 ueV (271.7-290.3 MHz). The green solid line (stroke RGB 0.416,0.827,0) was extracted from the vector PDF; axes calibrated from major tick marks (linear x: 270-290 MHz, log y: 1e-9 to 1e-4 GeV^-1); mass = h*f with h = 4.135668e-15 eV/Hz. Vertical end-walls of the excluded region were dropped; the jagged line was resampled to 80 log-median points per frequency bin. The same curve applies to both g_agamma and g_aBB; g_agamma reported as the canonical coupling. The blue dashed line in the figure is a cryogenic sensitivity projection and was not traced. The paper does not state its assumed local dark-matter density numerically (rho_a appears only symbolically); no density rescaling was applied, and dm_density_assumed=0.45 reflects the group's standard convention rather than an explicit statement. Systematic uncertainty on g quoted as ~26% (Appendix C).",
